  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{神経|しんけい} (nerves) + {質|しつ} (nature, quality)\n\nUSAGE:\nCan be used neutrally to describe someone sensitive, or negatively to suggest someone is overly anxious or fussy.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {神経質|しんけいしつ}な{人|ひと} - a nervous/sensitive person\n- {神経質|しんけいしつ}になる - to become nervous/fussy\n- 〜について{神経質|しんけいしつ}だ - to be particular about ~\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {繊細|せんさい} - delicate, sensitive (often positive)\n- {臆病|おくびょう} - timid, cowardly\n- {心配性|しんぱいしょう} - worrywart\n- ナーバス - nervous (loanword)",
